     "hs_enable_module_padding": true,
     "html": "<div>{{ contact.firstname }},</div>\n<p data-olk-copy-source=\"MessageBody\">Thank you for your interest in <span style=\"background:#FFF3CD;border-bottom:2px solid #8A6300;\" data-praxera-review=\"brand\">Praxera</span> and for reaching out through our website.</p>\n<p data-olk-copy-source=\"MessageBody\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p>We are not currently pursuing new international partnerships or opening new international accounts. As a result, we are unable to move forward with your request.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>We appreciate your interest in our products and company and will keep your information on file should our international strategy change in the future.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Thank you again for contacting us and for your understanding.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Sincerely,</p>\n<div><span style=\"background:#FFF3CD;border-bottom:2px solid #8A6300;\" data-praxera-review=\"brand\">Praxera</span></div>",
